    %% ---------- Runtime store access ----------
    ing_svc -->|writes vectors| d_qdrant
    ing_svc -->|writes| d_bm25
    ing_svc -->|writes| d_manifest
    ing_svc -->|writes bytes| d_raw
    ing_svc -->|writes sidecars| d_proc
    qs -->|reads/writes| d_qdrant
    bs -->|reads/writes| d_bm25
    ret_svc -->|reads| d_qdrant
    ret_svc -->|reads| d_bm25
